  "action": "Unblocked and completed the deferred sshd hardening. Owner joined mac-mini-vultr to the tailnet from the Vultr console (device <ip>; the earlier <ip> was a stale/unauthenticated number). Workstation reached it over the tailnet immediately (workstation IPv6 is still dead; tailnet path is now the preferred route). Hardening applied on the box: backup /etc/ssh/sshd_config.bak-hardening-20261023T125514Z; drop-in 00-hardening.conf (PasswordAuthentication no, KbdInteractiveAuthentication no, PermitRootLogin prohibit-password) which overrides 50-cloud-init.conf's PasswordAuthentication yes by lexical first-match; sshd -t VALID; reloaded; effective settings verified via sshd -T and a fresh post-reload key connection. Also fixed the workstation ssh alias (removed stale AddressFamily inet6 that broke the v4 tailnet address, repointed HostName to <ip>; alias verified). Docs updated and committed 6dc4f99. Vultr public IPv6 remains as fallback; no secrets stored."
